Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.10,1:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.45,1:01:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.50,1:01:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.43,1:02:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,臭婊子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirty cunt!
