Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.55,1:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是她 爸爸 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Was her. Papa, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.28,1:03:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.28,1:03:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 靠 - 该死 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - Goddamn it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.99,1:03:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.83,1:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.96,1:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.51,1:03:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.58,1:04:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,靠! 是斯汤普的头巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. It's Stump's headband.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.63,1:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.89,1:04:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.98,1:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.73,1:04:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.53,1:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.80,1:04:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.54,1:05:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,够了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.93,1:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拿破仑? 我们该走了 他有枪 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napoleon? We got to go. He's got a gun. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.31,1:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napoleon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.56,1:06:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,舱门 关舱门 关舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hatch. Get the hatch. Get the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.11,1:06:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy? !
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.66,1:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪条路?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.16,1:06:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里你们很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.41,1:06:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.08,1:06:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你后面 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.80,1:06:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.68,1:07:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这里到底发生了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.11,1:07:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.37,1:07:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 宝贝! 只是子弹多少的问题! 一定要多射几颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby! It's all about volume! Got to have volume!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.50,1:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是克朗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Crank.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.46,1:07:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 我很好 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - I'm all right. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,肩部受伤 没有伤到骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lone Ranger shoulder wound. Missed the bone completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.22,1:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.39,1:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.31,1:07:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在跟谁搞鬼呢 啊? 你在跟谁搞鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you fucking with, huh? Who you fucking with?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.48,1:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,克朗克? 克朗克? 你还剩有弹药吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank? Crank? You got any ammo left?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.82,1:08:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.12,1:08:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.42,1:08:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,德尔玛? 你的刺刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delmar? Your bayonet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.09,1:08:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克朗克! 德尔玛! - 靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crank! Delmar! - Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.97,1:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.64,1:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 靠 你们还活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! You guys are alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.52,1:08:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.90,1:08:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 靠 - 德尔玛 你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Delmar, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.32,1:08:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,出去了就一切都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a hell of a lot better when we get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你被击中了? - 我很好 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you shot? - I'm fine. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.03,1:08:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.45,1:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.82,1:08:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那到底是什么? - 他没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? - He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.24,1:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈疯了吗? 他是他们其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your goddamn mind? He's one of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.91,1:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他刚才救了我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he just saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.21,1:08:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不用怕 你们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fear. You come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.04,1:08:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:08:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.08,1:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.42,1:09:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗? - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.34,1:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不要担心 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.09,1:09:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须把他弄出这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.30,1:09:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜并不远 你听到过她的叫喊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy's not that far. You heard her screams.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.18,1:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有弹药我们怎么把她带离这里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're we gonna get her out of here without any goddamn ammo?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.68,1:09:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以用石头和枪柄来跟他们搏斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can fight them with rocks and rifle butts if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.77,1:09:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁被兰博附体了吗? - 我只是想把所有人都带离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's Rambo resurrected now? - I just wanna get everyone out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.94,1:09:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗? 那就去告诉 米奇、斯皮特还有斯汤普吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, tell that to Mickey, and Spitter, and Stump!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.86,1:09:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克朗克! 他妈的闭嘴 - 你相信那家伙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crank! Shut the hell up! - You trust that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.90,1:10:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他帮我们藏起来了 没有把我们交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hid us from them. He didn't give us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.82,1:10:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 不得不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have any choice. We have to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.61,1:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,胡扯! 天知道他会把我们带去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit! God knows where he's taking us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.91,1:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你老实讲 我不相信 老天会知道这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest with you, I'm not sure God knows anything about this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.87,1:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.17,1:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,必须穿过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.61,1:10:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.24,1:10:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.33,1:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.58,1:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.17,1:11:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天那 - 这他妈的都是什么啊? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeez! - What the fuck? !
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.71,1:11:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊! 米奇! - 不要去看!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God! Mickey! - Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.22,1:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你个恶心的混蛋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sick fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.68,1:11:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,该杀了你! 我该杀了你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be shot! I should kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.52,1:11:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克朗克! - 怎么 伙计?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crank! - What, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.44,1:12:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么老是 和我作对 德尔玛 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you always try to shut me down, Delmar, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.52,1:12:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不要发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他妈的怎么了? - 不要发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck? - Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.82,1:12:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不要发狂 不要发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out. Don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.07,1:12:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.78,1:12:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么了 什么? 德尔玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, what? Delmar!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.00,1:12:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,德尔玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delmar.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.62,1:12:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 伙计?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你被击中了两次?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hit twice?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.72,1:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你不告诉我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.05,1:12:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 伙计 千万别!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, man. Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.31,1:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 不要离开我 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this. Don't leave me, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的不要离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fucking leave me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.32,1:12:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.19,1:12:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,给我医药包 拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a medi-pack. Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.40,1:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,给我医药包 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a medi-pack. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.57,1:12:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,克朗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.04,1:13:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会丢下他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.50,1:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会丢下他的 你个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave him. You sick fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.62,1:13:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不会得到他的 - 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not gonna have him! - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.46,1:13:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带你离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.76,1:13:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.43,1:13:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.84,1:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带你离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 耶! 哦 耶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.03,1:14:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌这就是通向外面的 怎么才能打开这该死的门?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet this leads outside! How do I get this fucking door open?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.45,1:14:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 嘿 算了吧 克朗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Hey, would you forget it, Crank?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.00,1:14:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧 这是个防护门 你根本打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you forget it? It's a blast door. You're never gonna get it open.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.17,1:14:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}God dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要离开这里 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of here, you fucking retard!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.81,1:14:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克朗克! - 我们怎样才能离开这里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crank! - How the fuck do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.06,1:14:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Missy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.27,1:14:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能打消密茜还活着这个念头? 密茜已经死了 明白不?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you get off this shit that she's alive? Missy is fucking dead! Okay? !
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.52,1:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就像其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.40,1:14:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不离开这里 那我们也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like we're gonna be if we don't get the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.57,1:14:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不找到她我们不离开这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not leaving this place without her!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.70,1:15:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢 知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.83,1:15:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能离开这里? 哪条路能出去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the fuck do we get out of here, man? Which way is it? !
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.62,1:15:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那边是什么? 那边是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's over there? What's over here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我回去找她 - 安玻 待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going back for her! - Amber, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.13,1:15:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们! - 安玻?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! - Amber?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.84,1:15:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 靠! 伙计们 来看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Guys! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.88,1:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,正是我们需要的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we need...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.56,1:15:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要碰! 不要碰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touch! No touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.23,1:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,安玻! 求你了 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber! Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.90,1:15:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.57,1:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd go back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,安玻!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.25,1:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 耶! 哦 耶! 哦 靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.22,1:16:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,炸药 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dynamite. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.43,1:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 终于我可以离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. I'm gonna get out of here after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.40,1:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 耶 德尔玛? 我们要离开这里了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Delmar? We're getting out of here, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.16,1:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.21,1:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.88,1:16:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天那 克朗克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Crank!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.10,1:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.60,1:16:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 靠 克朗克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Crank!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.85,1:16:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,克朗克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.11,1:16:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,克朗克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.70,1:17:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是密茜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Missy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.99,1:19:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.49,1:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy's phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.28,1:19:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 你还有密茜的电话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Do you still have Missy's phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.13,1:20:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.76,1:20:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也受不了了 我不想安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can 't take it anymore. I can 't! I don 't wanna be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.64,1:20:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要离开这里 我们会死的 你不明白吗? 我们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want out of here. We're gonna die, don 't you get it? We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.73,1:20:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哪条路?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.52,1:20:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哪条路 拿破仑? 哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way do we go, Napoleon? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.74,1:20:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也受不了了 拿破仑 受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can 't take it anymore, Napoleon. I can 't!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.82,1:20:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.45,1:20:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会死的 你不明白吗? 我们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna die, don 't you get it? We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.62,1:20:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.83,1:20:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安玻! - 你还好吗? 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amber! - You okay? Give me this arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.21,1:20:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 和我待在一起 - 没事 我们找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay with me. - It's okay. We got you. We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.34,1:20:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.73,1:21:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爱你 妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.07,1:21:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,求你带我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.24,1:21:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要再让他碰我 - 快 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't let him touch me again. - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.41,1:21:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,求你 不要再让他碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Don't let him touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.87,1:21:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安玻 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amber. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.79,1:21:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们终于找到你了 - 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got you. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.08,1:21:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拿破仑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.33,1:21:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听不到他动静了 - 你在干吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't hear him anymore. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.88,1:21:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.10,1:21:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.57,1:22:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,过来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.70,1:22:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不! - 死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Die!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.91,1:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,婊子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.12,1:22:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.35,1:22:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拿破仑 站起来! 站起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napoleon, get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.23,1:22:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拿破仑 站起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napoleon, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.87,1:22:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.71,1:22:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,安玻!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.10,1:23:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,死 死 死 死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die. Die. Die. Die. Die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.69,1:23:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.57,1:23:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉好她 - 密茜 我们走 快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her! - Missy, let's go! Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.49,1:23:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.37,1:23:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜 快! 密茜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy! Come on! Missy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.92,1:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让他拿到他的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get his knife!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.92,1:23:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉! - 密茜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull! - Missy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.43,1:23:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的腿! 哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my leg! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.84,1:23:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.89,1:23:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜! 去拿武器!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy! Get something!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.56,1:23:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,密茜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.80,1:24:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.37,1:24:58.04,Note,,0,0,0,,国民自卫队训练兵和他们中士的失踪 从未向他们的家人解释过
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.04,1:25:02.84,Note,,0,0,0,,官方把他们列为擅离职守
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.10,1:25:14.85,Note,,0,0,0,,16区仍然是被认为不存在的
